    <body>
      <div xml:id="gom-is19">
        <head xml:id="gom-is19-Hd1e98">Caput 19</head>
        <div xml:id="gom-is19-Dd1e100">
          <head xml:id="gom-is19-Hd1e102">Versus 1</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is19-d1e104">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is19-Qd1e106" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is19_1@1-2">Onus Aegypti,</quote>
            etc.
            <ref xml:id="gom-is19-Rd1e109"><name xml:id="gom-is19-Nd1e110" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is19-Qd1e113">Sciendum multa quae hic dicuntur ad Aegyptum historialiter pertinere; sed, et hic et in aliis locis, Scripturarum multa ponuntur quae non possunt juxta historiam stare, ut rerum necessitate cogamur altiorem intelligentiam quaerere.</quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is19-d1e116">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is19-Qd1e118" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is19_1@3-5">Ecce Dominus ascendet,</quote>
            etc.
            <ref xml:id="gom-is19-Rd1e121"><name xml:id="gom-is19-Nd1e122" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is19-Qd1e125"><seg type="qs">Aegyptus, tenebrae <pb ed="#P" n="1260C"/> vel moeror</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">et corda sapientium Aegypti pavore tabuerunt.</seg></quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is19-d1e135">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is19-Qd1e137" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is19_1@14-15">Simulacra Aegypti.</quote>
            Idololatria fractam se sentiens, ut etiam magi a daemonibus docti, vel juxta prophetiam Balaam intelligentes natum Filium Dei, qui magicam destruerat artem, in Bethleem venerunt et Puerum adoraverunt.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is19-Dd1e142">
          <head xml:id="gom-is19-Hd1e144">Versus 2</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is19-d1e146">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is19-Qd1e148" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is19_2@1-3">Et concurrere faciam.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is19-Rd1e151"><name xml:id="gom-is19-Nd1e152" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is19-Qd1e155">Unde in Evangelio: <quote xml:id="gom-is19-Qd1e157">Non veni pacem mittere in terram, sed gladium: veni enim separare hominem a patre suo,</quote> etc., <!--<note>(Matth. X)</note>-->.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is19-Dd1e164">
          <head xml:id="gom-is19-Hd1e166">Versus 3</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is19-d1e168">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is19-Qd1e170" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is19_3@1-2">Et dirumpetur,</quote>
            etc.
            <ref xml:id="gom-is19-Rd1e173"><name xml:id="gom-is19-Nd1e174" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is19-Qd1e177">Dividetur in contraria voluntas Aegypti, ut non magna sentiant sicut ante, sed spirituali gladio separati, consilium suum cognoscant praecipitatum esse.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is19-Dd1e181">
          <head xml:id="gom-is19-Hd1e183">Versus 4</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is19-d1e185">
            <pb ed="#P" n="1260D"/>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is19-Qd1e189" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is19_4@6-7">Dominorum crudelium.</quote>
            Multis dominis Aegyptus tradita est. Primum Assyriis, post Nabuchodonosor, tertio Alexandro, ad ultimum Romanis, Antonio et Cleopatra ab Augusto superatis. Chaldaei crudeliores, Romani potentiores.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is19-Dd1e195">
          <head xml:id="gom-is19-Hd1e197">Versus 5</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is19-d1e199">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is19-Qd1e201" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is19_5@1-2">Et arescet.</quote>
            Fieri solet, ut cum ira Dei captivitas venit, ut indignationem ejus pestilentia subsequatur, et contra peccatores elementa desaeviant. Veniente ergo captivitate per Chaldaeos vel Romanos, forsitan et Nilus, et fontes siccati sunt. Hyperbolicos quoque propter nimiam tribulationem flumina possunt dici defecisse, et fontes aruisse et rivuli.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is19-Dd1e206">
          <head xml:id="gom-is19-Hd1e208">Versus 11</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is19-d1e210">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is19-Qd1e212" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is19_11@1-1">Stulti.</quote>
            Adveniente captivitate Babylonica <pb ed="#P" n="1261A"/> vel Romana, omnia magorum defecerunt consilia.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is19-d1e218">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is19-Qd1e220" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is19_11@2-3">Principes Thaneos.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is19-Rd1e223"><name xml:id="gom-is19-Nd1e224" ref="#Jerome">HIER.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is19-Qd1e227">Humilis mandati; omnes enim haeretici contrariam altitudini humilitatem docent, et ad inferos detrahunt, et humilis mandati et dejecti sunt principes.</quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is19-d1e230">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is19-Qd1e232" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is19_11@13-14">Filius sapientium.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is19-Qd1e235"><seg type="qs">Haec dicebat unusquisque Pharaoni</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">et deos magnos auctores suae gentis fuisse jactant Isim, et Osirim, et Typhonem.</seg></quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is19-d1e243">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is19-Qd1e245" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is19_11@17-18">Regum antiquorum.</quote>
            Quasi dicat: Habeo scientiam Scripturarum cum sapientia saeculari.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is19-Dd1e250">
          <head xml:id="gom-is19-Hd1e252">Versus 14</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is19-d1e254">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is19-Qd1e256" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is19_14@18-20">Ebrius et vomens.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is19-Rd1e259"><name xml:id="gom-is19-Nd1e260" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is19-Qd1e263">Furore draconum, ut tandem post vomitum intelligant ebrietatem suam. Quandiu enim ebrii fuerint, nec principium habebunt, nec finem.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is19-Dd1e267">
          <head xml:id="gom-is19-Hd1e269">Versus 15</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is19-d1e271">
            <pb ed="#P" n="1261B"/>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is19-Qd1e275" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is19_15@13-13">Refrenantem.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is19-Rd1e278"><name xml:id="gom-is19-Nd1e279">HAYMO.</name> in Isa.</ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is19-Qd1e282"><seg type="qs">Pro eo quod Hieronymus debuit transferre</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">alii prae lascivia quid faciant, nesciunt.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is19-Dd1e291">
          <head xml:id="gom-is19-Hd1e293">Versus 16</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is19-d1e295">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is19-Qd1e297" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is19_16@7-7">Mulieres.</quote>
            Quas amat Aegyptus, quas solas vult Pharao vivere, necatis viris. Diabolus virtutes interficit, vitia conservat.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is19-Dd1e302">
          <head xml:id="gom-is19-Hd1e304">Versus 17</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is19-d1e306">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is19-Qd1e308" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is19_17@3-5">Terra Juda Aegypto.</quote>
            Scientia Scripturarum lex, et prophetae; Evangelia erunt Aegypto in festivitatem cum se cognoverit, vel in timorem cum se mendacia habuisse intellexerit.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is19-d1e312">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is19-Qd1e314" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is19_17">In pavorem.</quote>
            <!-- check: lemma not matched to verse text -->
            <quote xml:id="gom-is19-Qd1e319"><seg type="qs">Alii in festivitatem</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">promittendo auxilium eis.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is19-Dd1e329">
          <head xml:id="gom-is19-Hd1e331">Versus 18</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is19-d1e333">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is19-Qd1e335" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is19_18@5-6">Quinque civitates.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is19-Qd1e338"><seg type="qs">Quidam quinque libros Moysi intelligunt</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">quia de vitiis ad virtutes commutantur.</seg></quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is19-d1e346">
            <pb ed="#P" n="1261C"/>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is19-Qd1e350" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is19_18">Lingua Chananaea.</quote>
            <!-- check: lemma not matched to verse text -->
            <quote xml:id="gom-is19-Qd1e355"><seg type="qs">Quaeritur cur non lingua Hebraea</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">et qui tactu immundo delectantur.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is19-Dd1e364">
          <head xml:id="gom-is19-Hd1e366">Versus 19</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is19-d1e368">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is19-Qd1e370" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is19_19@1-3">In die illa.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is19-Rd1e373"><name xml:id="gom-is19-Nd1e374">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is19-Qd1e376"><seg type="qs">Hoc non intelligens Onias sacerdos</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">et eos usque hodie linguam propriam tenuisse.</seg></quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is19-d1e384">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is19-Qd1e386" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is19_19@11-12">Et titulus.</quote>
            Titulus Domini evangelica doctrina et apostolica, quae est usque ad terminos terrae, unde: <quote xml:id="gom-is19-Qd1e389" source="http://scta.info/resource/ps18_5@1-6">In omnem terram exivit sonus eorum</quote>. Vel titulus juxta terminum fidei, operatio bona, quae quantum et fides extendi debet, vel imitatio passionis Christi.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is19-Dd1e394">
          <head xml:id="gom-is19-Hd1e396">Versus 20</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is19-d1e398">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is19-Qd1e400" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is19_20@13-14">Clamabunt enim.</quote>
            Cum evangelica doctrina creverit, et persecutio ingruerit, tunc qui crediderint, clamabunt ad Deum patrem.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is19-Dd1e405">
          <head xml:id="gom-is19-Hd1e407">Versus 23</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is19-d1e409">
            <pb ed="#P" n="1261D"/>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is19-Qd1e413" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is19_23@1-3">In die illa.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is19-Qd1e416"><seg type="qs">Ante adventum Domini, singulae nationes</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">qui de regno in regnum discurrunt.</seg></quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is19-d1e424">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is19-Qd1e426" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is19_23@18-20">Et servient Aegyptii.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is19-Qd1e429"><seg type="qs">Non quod postea illi fuissent subjugati</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">ejusdem cum ipsis conditionis.</seg></quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is19-d1e437">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is19-Qd1e439" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is19_23@1-4">In die illa erit.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is19-Rd1e442"><name xml:id="gom-is19-Nd1e443">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is19-Qd1e445">Non vicissim ab Assyriis Aegyptiisque medius vexabitur, sed erit tertius cum ipsis serviens, scilicet Romanis.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is19-Dd1e449">
          <head xml:id="gom-is19-Hd1e451">Versus 25</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is19-d1e453">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is19-Qd1e455" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is19_25@2-2">Benedictus.</quote>
            Hae regiones prae omnibus aliis monarchis abundaverant, et ideo benedici meruerunt.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </body>
